    "design": "Natural training contexts only, fixed hashed128documents and balanced4prefix lengths. Freeze model weights; differentiate sampled native log-probabilities wrt additive final-position L5H5 output. Average gradient outer products estimates local output-distribution Fisher in head coordinates. Compare first/second32sample halves. Ridge by .01/.1 times trace/128; train-centered PCA in resulting metric, using all32768natural training head vectors. Both metrics retained, no task-based choice. Audit native forward/capture replay, finite differences and metric algebra.",
